 			<p>This note, prettily written on scented paper, was a great contrast to the next, which was scribbled on a big sheet of thin foreign paper, ornamented with blots and all manner of flourishes and curly-tailed letters:⁠—</p>
 			<blockquote epub:type="z3998:letter">
